  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1762806857_1565891_b3e379e328794ec7b88bf2d0985feafd.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"179\" data-end=\"440\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"179\" data-end=\"194\">About Kameo</strong><br data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"197\">At Kameo, we believe that great sleep starts with products that adapt to you. That’s why we create smart mattresses and pillows that truly improve your rest — comfortable, stylish, and personal, designed to help you sleep better every night.</p><p data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"788\"><strong data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"469\">What makes us different</strong><br data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"472\">Kameo is part of <strong data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"504\">Swiss Sense</strong>, combining years of sleep expertise with innovative design. Our modular 6-in-1 mattress and ergonomic pillow provide customizable comfort for every type of sleeper. With 100 nights of risk-free trial, a 10-year warranty, and fair pricing, you can sleep with complete peace of mind.</p><p data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"1101\"><strong data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"817\">How affiliates can earn</strong><br data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"820\">As an affiliate, you’ll earn an attractive commission on every purchase made through your unique link. Thanks to our strong brand reputation, high customer satisfaction, and bestselling products (like the Kameo Pillow and Flex Mattress), conversions are high and returns are low.</p><p data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1393\"><strong data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1124\">How to promote us</strong><br data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1127\">Promote Kameo through social media, blogs, or newsletters. Focus on our core message: <em data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1230\">sleep your way.</em> Share real customer stories, before-and-after reviews, or lifestyle content about sleep, rest, and well-being. Use visuals that convey comfort, trust, and calm.</p><p data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1418\"><strong data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1416\">Other information</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1669\"><li data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1487\"><p data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1487\">Powered by <strong data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1447\">Swiss Sense</strong> – trusted quality, innovative design.</p></li><li data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1533\"><p data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1533\">Free shipping &amp; returns, 100-night trial.</p></li><li data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1593\"><p data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1593\">Products suited for every sleep position and body type.</p></li><li data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1669\"><p data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1669\">Perfect for affiliates in lifestyle, interior, sleep, or health niches.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
